nkrahmun%20Tombs\">Ankrahmun Tombs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Helheim\">Helheim</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ramoa\">Ramoa</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lich%20Hell\">Lich Hell</a>, beneath <a href=\"#/wiki/Fenrock\">Fenrock</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeper%20Banuta\">Deeper Banuta</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth Castle</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vandura%20Mountain\">Vandura Mountain</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robson's Isle</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Middle%20Spike\">Middle Spike</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Rock\">Lion's Rock</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mother%20of%20Scarabs%20Lair\">Mother of Scarabs Lair</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Caverna%20Exanima\">Caverna Exanima</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tBonebeasts fight until death.<br/><br/>A bonebeast attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tUse blockers to lure it, but avoid contact, while distance fighters shoot at it. A level 40 mage can survive healing with Intense Healing spell when soloing it. It's not recommended for knights to attempt soloing a <b>bonebeast</b> until level 50+. They yield good experience, especially for paladins considering it's not hard to kill them at a distance. Mages should run and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Flame%20Strike\">Flame Strike</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Hailstorm%20Rod\">Hailstorm Rod</a> for <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a>. Running from them can result in running into bigger spawns, especially on <a href=\"#/wiki/Ramoa\">Ramoa</a>. For <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin</a> the best thing to do is to run with Royal Spear or Enchanted Spear and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Missile\">Divine Missile</a> and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a> when surrounded. If your hp gets below 300, use Light Healing or Intense Healing.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"very rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 6,439 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bone\"><img alt=\"Bone\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bone_cc31a5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Bone\">Bone</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.50</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"49.697158\" style=\"text-align:center;\">50%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-90</td>\n<td>13.3</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"28.762230\" style=\"text-align:center;\">